    },
    {
      "code": "DRV-01",
      "name": "Drive Cluster",
      "deck": "Eng",
      "color": "#ffb070",
      "view": [-1, 0.3, 0.7],
      "dist": 260,
      "radius": 20,
      "description": "Six fusion nozzles on a hexagonal frame, lit for the first eighty years and again for the last hundred and forty. Between those two burns the ship coasts at 0.19 c and the drives are cold enough to walk on. Cruise acceleration was 0.009 g, which nobody aboard could feel and which is why the rings exist.",
      "stats": [
